## What this does

Orbit's Productivity now shows the same numbers as the Power BI **Office Productivity Report**, because it runs the report's own measures against the published model. Call Logs gains a Queue filter and wider search.

- **Queues** (`/call-activity/queues`): a tile per queue or queue group with Total, Answered, Abandoned, Abandon Rate, Voicemails, Missed and SLA. Clicking a tile opens that queue's people (`/queues/queue/<key>`, `/queues/group/<slug>`), and the rows add up to the tile through "Other people (N)" and "No agent". Calls with no queue (transferred in) get their own tile, with a "Transferred in from" list.
- **People** (`/call-activity/people`, `/people/<email>`): the original Tracker table, with these changes:
  - the Org Chart department;
  - people search;
  - column sorting;
  - a frozen header;
  - one line per person at 1920 px;
  - "+N past due" FieldRoutes tasks.

  The person page drops the View Scorecard and View Calls buttons.
- **Hourly Breakdown** (`/call-activity/hourly-breakdown`): inbound calls per queue by start time in Arizona time, in 1-hour or 30-minute slots, with a CSV download.
- **SLA** is TalkDesk's own % Service Level: calls answered inside service level ÷ inbound business-hours calls minus short abandons, per queue.
- **Who sees what is unchanged from today:**
  - an admin sees everyone;
  - managers and leads see their own people and only the queues those people work;
  - members see only themselves.

  Office-by-office rules are built and tested, but kept on a separate branch (`feature/productivity-office-rules`) until another office joins TalkDesk and Power BI.
- **Call Logs:**
  - a Queue column and filter, backed by a new indexed `calls.call_ring_group` column;
  - an Org Chart Department column and filter;
  - search covers every visible column: agent, department, queue, customer, phone, account #, call type, summary and ID;
  - a frozen header.
- **Freshness:** the Productivity cache follows the Power BI refresh, and the page shows a "TalkDesk data through …" note. The warm cron now runs only around the 7:30 AM Arizona refresh.
- Old `/call-activity/dashboard` and `/tracker` addresses redirect in one hop.
